---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { pages } from '../lib/registry';
---

<Page
  {...pages['/privacy/']}
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Start', href: '/' },
    { label: 'Privacy', href: '/privacy/' },
  ]}
>
  <header class="page-intro wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Website and enquiries</p>
    <h1>Your information.</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      This site is designed to let you read the work and make contact without
      creating an account.
    </p>
  </header>
  <article class="reading">
    <h2>Browsing</h2>
    <p>
      The site does not include advertising, paid visitor analytics or a live AI
      chatbot. The hosting provider may process standard connection information
      when serving pages. Production hosting details will be confirmed before
      launch.
    </p>
    <h2>Email enquiries</h2>
    <p>
      An email link opens your own email application. Information you choose to
      send is used to understand and respond to your enquiry. Email is handled
      through the receiving email provider; avoid sending sensitive business
      data or credentials in an initial message.
    </p>
    <h2>External articles and demonstrations</h2>
    <p>
      Some links open original articles, repositories or media hosted elsewhere.
      Those services have their own information-handling practices. Recovered
      articles preserve source links and may include original externally hosted
      demonstrations.
    </p>
    <h2>Changes and questions</h2>
    <p>
      Any future form, analytics or other third-party integration needs a
      corresponding update here. Contact{' '}
      <a href="mailto:moldach686@gmail.com">moldach686@gmail.com</a> with
      website privacy questions.
    </p>
  </article>
</Page>
